WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.368 --> 00:00:03.451
(instrumental music)

00:00:06.329 --> 00:00:08.412
(rattle)

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:11.333
- Shit.

00:00:15.559 --> 00:00:17.137
(exhales)

00:00:17.137 --> 00:00:18.475
So I tried to schedule it earlier

00:00:18.475 --> 00:00:20.928
but they had a cancellation
so if I didn't take that

00:00:20.928 --> 00:00:22.902
then I wouldn't be able to
see my doctor for like a week.

00:00:22.902 --> 00:00:24.465
- Okay, I understand.

00:00:24.465 --> 00:00:26.592
I'm just wondering how
many of these appointments

00:00:26.592 --> 00:00:27.748
there's gonna be.

00:00:27.748 --> 00:00:29.071
Okay, if you're stressed out about class

00:00:29.071 --> 00:00:30.541
maybe consider dropping something

00:00:30.541 --> 00:00:31.860
taking a lighter course load.

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:34.496
- It's not about being
stressed out in class.

00:00:34.496 --> 00:00:36.739
- Have you tried yoga?

00:00:36.739 --> 00:00:38.651
I don't know.

00:00:38.651 --> 00:00:39.674
- Doesn't work.

00:00:39.674 --> 00:00:41.344
- Maybe you should try smoking weed.

00:00:41.344 --> 00:00:43.768
- No, that just makes me more anxious.

00:00:43.768 --> 00:00:46.619
- What about acupuncture?

00:00:46.619 --> 00:00:49.702
(instrumental music)

00:00:52.291 --> 00:00:53.183
- Barbara.

00:00:53.183 --> 00:00:54.390
- I'm sorry Ms. Darragh

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:56.222
but we need your doctor
to authorize a refill.

00:00:56.222 --> 00:01:00.772
- Yes, but Barbara you know
that I need my prescription.

00:01:00.772 --> 00:01:04.430
Barbara, Babs, come on, we go back.

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:06.168
I'm here every 30 days,

00:01:06.168 --> 00:01:09.918
sometimes sooner if I
have a yeast infection.

00:01:11.345 --> 00:01:12.827
I have anxiety.

00:01:12.827 --> 00:01:15.280
Okay, I have anxiety today,
I had anxiety yesterday,

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:16.729
I have no reason to believe

00:01:16.729 --> 00:01:19.534
that I won't have anxiety tomorrow.

00:01:19.534 --> 00:01:20.922
- If you get your doctor
to call in the refill--

00:01:20.922 --> 00:01:25.571
- Barbara, can you not just
help me out on like principle?

00:01:25.571 --> 00:01:27.571
Didn't you take an oath?

00:01:28.899 --> 00:01:29.819
- [Voiceover] You'll need to come in

00:01:29.819 --> 00:01:32.230
and see Dr. Graff Breaman
for a 20-minute appointment.

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:34.369
- Okay, can I come in today at lunch?

00:01:34.369 --> 00:01:35.455
(laughs)

00:01:35.455 --> 00:01:38.727
- No, the earliest appointment
is next week at two PM.

00:01:38.727 --> 00:01:40.346
- Um, actually I'm out of pills though.

00:01:40.346 --> 00:01:42.711
- Maybe schedule your
appointment in advance?

00:01:42.711 --> 00:01:44.713
- I did actually but I had to cancel it

00:01:44.713 --> 00:01:46.459
because I had a geology
exam and with geology

00:01:46.459 --> 00:01:48.220
you have to be there in person because--

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:51.216
- [Voiceover] So do you
want the appointment?

00:01:51.216 --> 00:01:52.049
- Sure.

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:55.554
- [Doctor] So it's working well?

00:01:55.554 --> 00:01:56.387
- Yep.

00:01:56.387 --> 00:01:57.466
- Any new side effects?

00:01:57.466 --> 00:01:59.129
- It's just that last week

00:01:59.129 --> 00:02:01.781
was a really tough week for me and--

00:02:01.781 --> 00:02:04.091
- If you'd like I can
put you on another drug

00:02:04.091 --> 00:02:06.306
that some others have
had some success with.

00:02:06.306 --> 00:02:07.697
It's an anti-seizure drug.

00:02:07.697 --> 00:02:09.025
- I don't have seizures.

00:02:09.025 --> 00:02:10.291
- Yes, but another effect of the drug--

00:02:10.291 --> 00:02:12.461
- Okay, but I still need
to come back in two months?

00:02:12.461 --> 00:02:14.181
- Actually, I'd like
to see you in one month

00:02:14.181 --> 00:02:16.187
if we put you on this.

00:02:16.187 --> 00:02:20.358
(instrumental music
changes to dramatic music)

00:02:20.358 --> 00:02:21.191
(beating)

00:02:21.191 --> 00:02:24.742
- Oh God, One, two, three, four, five,

00:02:24.742 --> 00:02:26.442
six, seven, eight, nine.

00:02:26.442 --> 00:02:28.315
One, two, three,

00:02:28.315 --> 00:02:30.045
(gasps)

00:02:30.045 --> 00:02:32.378
one, two, three, four, five.

00:02:36.337 --> 00:02:39.301
Yeah hi, I'm calling
to check up on a refill

00:02:39.301 --> 00:02:43.279
for Darragh last name,
first name Kelsey with a K.

00:02:43.279 --> 00:02:45.103
(beating and dramatic music)

00:02:45.103 --> 00:02:45.936
1990.

00:02:48.778 --> 00:02:51.361
45, you said 45 30 minutes ago.

00:02:52.576 --> 00:02:55.409
(heavy breathing)

00:02:58.256 --> 00:03:00.089
- It'll be 15 minutes.

00:03:05.377 --> 00:03:07.466
(exhales)

00:03:07.466 --> 00:03:11.466
(melancholy instrumental music)

00:03:18.476 --> 00:03:19.309
Darragh!

00:03:21.421 --> 00:03:23.241
That'll be a $600 copay.

00:03:23.241 --> 00:03:24.074
- What?

00:03:24.074 --> 00:03:26.636
- I'm sorry, did you want the generic?

00:03:26.636 --> 00:03:28.978
- Obviously Barbara.

00:03:28.978 --> 00:03:31.478
- Okay, that'll be 45 minutes.

00:03:35.733 --> 00:03:38.314
(shuffling)

00:03:38.314 --> 00:03:41.147
(heavy breathing)

00:03:44.252 --> 00:03:47.744
(engine and beeping)

00:03:47.744 --> 00:03:50.327
(techno music)

00:04:22.331 --> 00:04:24.414
(rattle)

00:04:25.592 --> 00:04:26.425
- Shit.

00:04:29.052 --> 00:04:31.635
(techno music)

00:04:43.128 --> 00:04:45.795
(digital tones)

